  "updated_at": "2026-03-28",
  "bio": "Bartosz Bartecki is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in black & gray realism, crafting intricate designs with masterful precision. Located in Poznań, Poland, Bartecki's professionalism and attention to detail ensure every client's vision is translated into stunning body art in a meticulously clean and safe environment. His clients consistently praise the impeccable quality of his work and the serene atmosphere of his studio.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Poznan, Greater Poland Voivodeship, Poland\n\nDevelop success from failures. Discouragement and failure are two of the surest stepping stones to success 👌👌.",
